).","financial_summary":["Cannae Holdings, Inc. is a small-cap consumer cyclical business with a $767M market cap on $424M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at -4% over the past three years, and a shrinking top line is the hardest headwind any business can overcome.","Returns on capital run at -4% against a 10% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests.","The company is burning through $28M of cash, and without positive owner earnings any valuation rests on hope rather than evidence.","Accruals are elevated at -37.5% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, thin -10.1\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Management returns a meaningful 45.6% of market cap to owners through dividends and buybacks, a strong signal of disciplined capital allocation, and insiders hold 18% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (1.6) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Consumer Cyclical peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Operating margins 36% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Trading near 52-week highs \u2014 the market has already recognised the story","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.3470576003327096},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 9.8% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Value-trap profile (score 76/100): structural revenue/margin decline; leveraged balance sheet under pressure \u2014 cheapness may reflect deterioration, not mispricing","sev":"amber","cat":"value_trap"},{"text":"Revenue growth lags most Consumer Cyclical peers \u2014 losing share inside the profit pool","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Cyclical sectors like Consumer Cyclical tend to underperform in slowdowns","sev":"amber","cat":"sector"},{"text":"Brand relevance decay \u2014 shifting consumer preferences and social-media-driven trends can strand inventory and invalidate positioning faster than product cycles can adapt.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Valued at a 255% discount to sector median EV/EBITDA","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk","Consumer Cyclical sector outperforming the broader market over the past quarter"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Cannae Holdings declares $0.15 dividend (NYSE:CNNE)","source":"seekingalpha.com","link":"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4666107-cannae-holdings-declares-0_15-dividend","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793848055.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["dividend"]},{"title":"Cannae (CNNE) Set to Release Quarterly Earnings on Monday","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/02/cannae-cnne-set-to-release-quarterly-earnings-on-monday.html","date":"2026-11-02","timestamp":1793626987.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.802,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Precision Trading with Cannae Holdings Inc. (CNNE) Risk Zones","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/40/Precision_Trading_with_Cannae_Holdings_Inc._CNNE_Risk_Zones_103126014402_1793468642.html","date":"2026-10-31","timestamp":1793468642.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.494,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Lesaka Technologies (NASDAQ:LSAK) and Cannae (NYSE:CNNE) Head-To